  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1093382/description_fecbf4ad-b78d-40b0-a02d-3b9301f78884.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"813\" height=\"214\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><strong>Society: Sunlit Valley</strong> 是一款以&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>星露谷物语</strong></span> 和 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>牧场物语</strong></span> 等游戏为风格的农业商业整合包。随着你的进展，你将使用金钱购买新物品、升级农场，并制作更优良的工具来更快地赚钱。</span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1093382/description_269d7540-a19c-42d4-9f32-c5347326bc07.png\" alt=\"Features banner\" width=\"836\" height=\"105\"></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>内置经济系统</strong></span>：通过运输各种物品赚取金钱。专注于养殖农场动物、酿造葡萄酒、发掘文物等等！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>农业种植</strong></span></span> <span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">每个季节都有专属的作物和果树可供种植。结</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">合多种模组烹饪和酿造各种物品，从</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">而提升你的利润空间！</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>骷髅洞穴</strong></span>：深入探索骷髅洞穴，这是一个自定义的洞穴维度，每天都会重置。击碎巨石，沿着绳索下降到更加危险但更有价值的区域。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>详细任务</strong></span>：需要一些指引吗？任务书将为你提供深入的教程，带你逐步了解进度路线。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>技能</strong></span>：逐步解锁 5 棵自定义技能树，为你的农业、采矿、钓鱼、畜牧和冒险带来变革性的加成！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>多人游戏</strong></span>：本整合包专为多人服务器设计，提供保护贵重物品和与其他玩家交易的方式。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1093382/description_6210458c-28bb-4bf0-88df-3b329877a8c5.png\" alt=\"Farm types banner\" width=\"836\" height=\"105\"></span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>作物</strong></span>：耕种田地，培育种类繁多的作物和果树，包括难以获得的<strong>远古水果</strong>……</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>畜牧养殖</strong></span>：利用独特的亲密度机制饲养农场动物！你对牲畜越好，它们带来的收益就越高。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>史莱姆牧场</strong></span>：饲养超过 20 种<strong>绚丽史莱姆</strong>。用它们喜爱的食物喂养它们，收集它们的<strong>Plorts</strong>，并将它们合成为<strong>Largos</strong>！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>手工制品</strong></span>：制作奶酪、葡萄酒、啤酒和其他高价值产品。你甚至可以将它们放入<strong>陈酿桶</strong>中进行陈化，让利润随时间成倍增长！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>鱼类养殖</strong></span>：放下钓竿，建造一个<strong>鱼塘</strong>！通过养殖鱼类获取鱼子及其他珍贵产物。完成挑剔鱼类的任务，并升级你的鱼塘。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>自动化</strong></span>：每一种农场类型都可以完全自动化，尽管实现这一点可能需要大量金钱和珍贵矿物。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1093382/description_47bd4f43-b67c-4d71-8104-3b7df1d43b1b.png\" alt=\"Community banner\" width=\"836\" height=\"105\"></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">有问题、反馈或建议？想聊聊整合包或寻找服务器一起玩？加入我们的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/GdcZkrZqkj\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>！也可以查看&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsunlitvalley.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fMain_Page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Society: Sunlit Valley Wiki</a>&nbsp;获取整合包信息和故障排除指南。</span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">玩家自制攻略</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">鱼塘任务电子表格由 <strong>Lazerz&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1RlCL9w96E3C4TYx3SuSfBe0YuY4l9e7FF96_olIPFUU/edit?gid=2094650947#gid=2094650947\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">骷髅洞穴生存指南由 <strong>Devon </strong><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1pk3OQxsKQ3hTeuYIA0L-s4yblvyBCfQOMD36CGxXUUw/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.xan6cuu8emq\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看</a></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">想要搭建服务器？</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">我们的合作伙伴 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://billing.bloom.host/aff.php?aff=21/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bloom Host</a></strong> 为 Sunlit Valley 提供强大便捷的服务器托管服务，配备专属 Ryzen 9 CPU。使用优惠码 <strong>SOCIETY</strong> 可在首张账单享受 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://billing.bloom.host/aff.php?aff=21/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1093382/description_bca58fec-6bd5-4795-b567-aeeb1009f7e7.gif\" alt=\"Bloom Host\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">媒体</span></h2></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/na4baHF5p4w?si=nUye4H-MTSzdaPAy\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\"><span><span><span><span><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/c7jxIsgKs88?si=E7_aVMM-Y3UZavBs\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:verdana, geneva, serif\">额外致谢</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>着色器由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Reimagined</a> 提供 - 如有问题请向整合包反馈，而非着色器开发者！</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Eidolon</strong></span> : 由 Alexth99 重新制作 (文物素材)</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Embers Rekindled</strong></span> -&nbsp;BordListian&nbsp;(文物素材)</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Blazing Drift Fever EX - Eurobeat</strong></span> by CattonArthur (猪跑竞速音乐)</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Uni</strong></span> - 骷髅洞穴世界生成核心设计者</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Tilles</strong></span>- 铱金材质重绘</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Matt</strong></span> - 骷髅洞穴建筑结构</li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">emma, providencedaemon &amp;</span> frog</strong>&nbsp;- 提供建议、反馈及杂项工作</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>NerdySpider</strong></span> - 约 50 个物品纹理</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>malcolmriley</strong></span> - 来自 <a href=\"https://github.com/malcolmriley/unused-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">unused-textures</a> 库的各种随机纹理</li>\n</ul>",
